                        </p>
                    </div>


                    <div class="career-card">
                        <div class="career-card-icon">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-flask"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h4>Chemical Engineer</h4>
                        <p>
                            Apply chemical processes to create
                            useful products and solutions.
                        </p>
                    </div>


                    <div class="career-card">
                        <div class="career-card-icon">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-code"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h4>Software Engineer</h4>
                        <p>
                            Develop reliable and scalable software
                            systems and applications.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>


            <!-- =================================================
                 BUSINESS
            ================================================== -->

            <div class="career-category">

                <div class="career-category-header">

                    <div class="career-category-icon">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-chart-pie"></i>
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <h3>Business & Finance</h3>
