                        </p>
                    </div>


                    <div class="career-card">
                        <div class="career-card-icon">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-calculator"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h4>Accountant</h4>
                        <p>
                            Manage financial records and
                            support financial compliance.
                        </p>
                    </div>


                    <div class="career-card">
                        <div class="career-card-icon">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-users"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h4>Human Resources Manager</h4>
                        <p>
                            Manage recruitment, employee relations
                            and organizational development.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>


            <!-- =================================================
                 HEALTHCARE
            ================================================== -->

            <div class="career-category">

                <div class="career-category-header">

                    <div class="career-category-icon">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-heart-pulse"></i>
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <h3>Healthcare</h3>
                        <span>Make a meaningful difference in people's lives</span>
                    </div>

                </div>


                <div class="career-grid">

                    <div class="career-card">
                        <div class="career-card-icon">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-user-doctor"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h4>Doctor / Physician</h4>
                        <p>
                            Diagnose and treat medical conditions
                            while supporting patient health.
                        </p>
                    </div>


                    <div class="career-card">
                        <div class="career-card-icon">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-user-nurse"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h4>Nurse</h4>
